#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:12
msgid "NeoChat"
msgstr "NeoChat"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:13
msgid "A client for matrix, the decentralized communication protocol"
msgstr "Un cliente de Matrix, li protocol de communication decentralisat"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"NeoChat is a Matrix client. It allows you to send text messages, videos and "
"audio files to your family, colleagues and friends using the Matrix protocol."
msgstr ""
"NeoChat es un cliente de Matrix. On posse usar it por inviar missages "
"textual, video- e audiofiles a su familie, colegos e amics med li protocol "
"Matrix."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:16
msgid ""
"Matrix is a decentralized communication protocol, putting the user back in "
"control. Currently NeoChat implements large part of the protocol with the "
"exception of encrypted chats and video chat."
msgstr ""
"Matrix es un decentralisat protocol de communication quel retroda li control "
"a un usator. Actualmen, NeoChat implementa un grand parte del protocol "
"except ciffrat conversationes e videotelefonada."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:17
msgid ""
"NeoChat works both on mobile and desktop while providing a consistent user "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"NeoChat supporta amb computatores e aparates mobil, ancor providente un "
"consistent experientie de usator."

#. (itstool) path: component/developer_name
#: org.kde.neochat.appdata.xml:24
msgid "The KDE Community"
msgstr "Li comunité de KDE"
